i-secondary-font\">Usable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.60<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">June 30, 2010<br/>Summer Update 2010</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20100901190933&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Solitude_Charm_09a2d2.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a solitude charm.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 10.00 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">The Wisdom of Solitude is contained in it.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>This item can be used to provide the user the blessing Wisdom of Solitude. It only works once, then it disappears, the Green Sparkles Effect <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Sparkles Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Sparkles_Effect_f26b9f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> appears on the user and the following message will appear: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">The Wisdom of Solitude inspires you.</span><br/>If the user already has the blessing, the following message will appear in orange preventing using it: <span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\">You already possess this blessing.</span><br/>It is quite valuable to free account players since it gives one of the only blessings they can not buy.\nA reward from the <a href=\"#/quest/rise-of-devovorga\">Rise of Devovorga</a> world quest.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a></li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blessing%20Charms\">Blessing Charms</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Blessings\">Blessings</a></li><li>Bosses</li><li>Dreamhaunters</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Gaz%27haragoth\">Gaz'haragoth</a></li><li>Green Sparkles Effect</li><li>Light Sources</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/rise-of-devovorga\">Rise of Devovorga</a></li><li>Status Effects</li><li>Wisdom of Solitude</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/World%20Quests\">World Quests</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["rise-of-devovorga"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"rise-of-devovorga","quest":"Rise of Devovor